OL,3,GNEWSAAirport boss defends car parking
OL,4,Aincome
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of Manchester Airport has
OL,7,Fdefended car parking charges there,
OL,8,Farguing they are "competitive".
OL,10,FChris Woodroofe was responding to a
OL,11,Fcustomer who asked how the airport can
OL,12,Fjustify more than #150 charge for
OL,13,Fparking for two weeks.
OL,15,FThe managing director said the cost was
OL,16,F"exactly the same sort of charge" as
OL,17,Fparking in a town centre for the day,
OL,18,Fbut some customers have said they felt
OL,19,Fthe charges were unreasonable.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
