OL,3,GNEWSAAirport boss defends car parking
OL,4,Aincome
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester Airports Group (MAG) - which
OL,7,Falso includes London Stansted and East
OL,8,FMidlands Airports - recently recorded
OL,9,Fit had made #453m from parking, about a
OL,10,Fthird of its income.
